Renderer: machine-cached chrome-headless-shell (playwright cache; pre-existing
on host, no browser/driver installed by this lane)
  $HOME/Library/Caches/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1234/chrome-headless-shell-mac-arm64/chrome-headless-shell
  (same engine design-gate-evidence.sh uses for prototype renders)

Commands (per screen; one invocation per file — headless-shell flakes when
chained):

  ## Phone frames (390x844 gate): 2x render, downscale to exactly 390x844
  chrome-headless-shell --headless --disable-gpu --no-first-run --hide-scrollbars \
    --user-data-dir=$(mktemp -d) --window-size=390,844 --force-device-scale-factor=2 \
    --screenshot=render-2x.png file://<repo>/docs/design/evidence/issue-271/<prototype-*.html>
  sips -z 844 390 render-2x.png --out <variant>-*390x844.png

  ## Board frames: 1040x720 mock window (real egui window is resizable;
  ## phone surface is the pinned 390x844 evidence size)
  chrome-headless-shell --headless --disable-gpu --no-first-run --hide-scrollbars \
    --user-data-dir=$(mktemp -d) --window-size=1040,720 --force-device-scale-factor=2 \
    --screenshot=render-2x.png file://<repo>/docs/design/evidence/issue-271/<prototype-*.html>
  sips -z 720 1040 render-2x.png --out <variant>-board.png

